<section class="relative overflow-hidden">
<div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-60" style="background:radial-gradient(ellipse at top, oklch(0.9 0.06 85 / 0.6), transparent 60%)">
</div>
<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pt-16 pb-24 md:pt-24 md:pb-32 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center relative">
<div class="text-center md:text-left">
<div class="flex md:justify-start justify-center items-center gap-3 mb-6">
<img src="/images/qalbquest-logo.svg" alt="QalbQuest logo — two swans forming a heart" class="h-14 w-14"/>
</div>
<div class="tracking-luxury text-xs text-gold-dark mb-6">QALBQUEST · TWO HEARTS, ONE RHYTHM</div>
<h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-6xl leading-[1.05] text-foreground">The conversations that shape your future<span class="italic text-gold-gradient"> shouldn&#x27;t be the ones you avoid.</span>
</h1>
<p class="mt-6 text-lg text-muted-foreground max-w-xl md:max-w-lg mx-auto md:mx-0">Thoughtful questions designed to help couples explore values, expectations, and dreams before taking the next step together.</p>
<div class="mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 md:justify-start justify-center items-center">
<a href="#download" class="btn-gold btn-gold-hover inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-8 py-5 text-sm tracking-luxury uppercase leading-normal whitespace-nowrap">Seek true Alignment</a>
<span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground tracking-wider">iOS in 5 days · Android coming soon</span>

</div>
